1c8n|n|Great in quantity; long in duration; as, much rain has fallen; much time. ; Many in number. ; High in rank or position. ; A great quantity; a great deal; also, an indefinite quantity; as, you have as much as I. ; A thing uncommon, wonderful, or noticeable; something considerable.	N:1dir,35,3;1t3s,11,1~1dir,35,3;1t3s,11,1
